        Explore Gujarat's foremost engineering portfolio. From monolithic infinity horizons and mirror overflow decks to rapid FRP shells, discover the exact pool archetype engineered for your property.
      </p>

      <div class="page-hero-actions">
        <a href="#interactive-showcase" class="btn btn-yellow" style="box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45); font-weight: 800;">
